Missing required configuration for `demo`

The following value(s) are missing:
  - `reference`
  - `database`
  - `database.host`

Please provide them using one of the following methods, in order of precedence:
  1. Command-Line Argument:
     --reference <value>
  2. Environment Variable:
     MRQ_REFERENCE=<value>
     MRN_DATABASE=<value>
     MRN_DATABASE__HOST=<value>
  3. Configuration File:
     reference = "<value>"
     [database]
     [database]
     host = "<value>"
